 "descripcion": "The Qinghai-Tibet railway runs over hundreds of kilometers of frozen ground. If that ground thaws, the tracks sink. So engineers built ways to keep the soil frozen all year.\n\nWhat should we explain next?\n\n#howitworks #engineering #science #shorts",
